# Keep the build context small and the image free of local state.
#
# Two of these matter for correctness rather than size:
#   uploads/    - user documents. Shipping them would put one deployment's
#                 private files inside every image built from this context.
#   vector_db/  - the retrieval index. It is stamped with the embedding backend
#                 that built it, but the safest thing is not to ship a stale
#                 index at all: the container builds its own on first boot.
.venv
__pycache__
.pytest_cache
.env
uploads
vector_db
temp_vector_db
upload_vector_db
.model_cache
.git
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
tests
test_*.py
